---
# The unit tests: everything in ../.clang-tidy, minus what a test file is
# made of. Literal boards, seeds and counts are the test data, so no named
# constants for them; and CHECK has to be a macro to stringify its condition
# and record __LINE__.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers,
  -cppcoreguidelines-macro-usage,
  -readability-magic-numbers
...
